<title>GERMANY: Bundesbank data show rise in net reserves in week.</title>
<headline>Bundesbank data show rise in net reserves in week.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank data released on Friday show that net currency reserves rose to about 106.3 billion marks in the week ending October 7 from about 105.5 billion marks in the week ending September 30.</p>
<p>The Bundesbank provided the following reserve data: (in billion marks)</p>
<p> Banking week ended		    October 7     Sept 30</p>
<p> Gross currency reserves	     122.1	   121.6</p>
<p> Foreign liabilities		   15.8	    16.1</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
